      "text": "Cálculo del Costo Promedio Ponderado (RN-10)",
      "originalText": "Cálculo del Costo Promedio Ponderado (RN-10)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "d839d0ae92d271c5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 2348,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 17,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a10",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1504405769,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1598305118,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774483200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CPP nuevo = ((stock actual × CPP actual) + (cantidad recibida × costo unitario)) / (stock actual + cantidad recibida)",
      "originalText": "CPP nuevo = ((stock actual × CPP actual) + (cantidad recibida × costo unitario)) / (stock actual + cantidad recibida)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2eed082a21ae23c5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 2382,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 17,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a11",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1820308618,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1918832603,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774483200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Ejemplo verificable: 100 unidades a $10 más 100 unidades a $20 da un CPP de exactamente $15.",
      "originalText": "•  Ejemplo verificable: 100 unidades a $10 más 100 unidades a $20 da un CPP de exactamente $15.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "dafc3cd85ec609b7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 2406,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 17,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a12",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1208231531,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 510508881,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774483200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  El CPP sólo se recalcula ante ingresos valorizados; las salidas lo consumen pero no lo alteran.",
      "originalText": "•  El CPP sólo se recalcula ante ingresos valorizados; las salidas lo consumen pero no lo alteran.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cdfbd11cfe44295a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 2430,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 17,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a13",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2117779150,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 257308416,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774483200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Un fallo en cualquier paso revierte stock y costo a la vez: nunca quedan desincronizados.",
      "originalText": "•  Un fallo en cualquier paso revierte stock y costo a la vez: nunca quedan desincronizados.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
